MPUI_DESC_MAP_ABANDON_SH	A mid-sized theme park.
MPUI_DESC_MAP_CHA_QUAD	A secluded monastery perched on a cliff.
MPUI_DESC_MAP_MIDEAST	An oasis town square.
MPUI_DESC_MAP_SEATOWN	Spend an afternoon in a lively seaside town and take on the enemy in frantic close-quarters fights in its narrow streets.
MPUI_MIDEAST	Oasis
MPUI_SEATOWN	Seatown
