MPUI_DESC_MAP_DOME	A radar station.
MPUI_SD_PILLARS	Royal Garden
MPUI_DESC_SD_PILLARS	A garden wired with power lines on the roof of one of New York's hottest buildings. Fighting here takes real skill.
MPUI_HARDHAT	Hardhat
MPUI_DESC_MAP_HARDHAT	An abandoned industrial site in the city, full of steel and danger. Come and fight it out!
MPUI_MP_STRIKE_SH	Strike
MPUI_DESC_MP_STRIKE_SH	A city in the vast desert of the Middle East. A Call of Duty 4: Modern Warfare competitive map where the fighting never stops: bring your weapons and settle it in Strike.
MPUI_QADEEM	Qadeem
MPUI_DESC_MAP_QADEEM	A luxury resort in the Middle East, built around an old coastal fortress. A beautiful coast outside and lavish halls inside, but watch out for heavy enemy fire.
MPUI_HUNGER	Hunger
MPUI_DESC_MAP_HUNGER	A large map: an abandoned town to the west, open fields and woods to the east.
